<title>USA: ISRAELI ENVOY SAYS SYRIA PREPARING FOR WAR.</title>
<headline>ISRAELI ENVOY SAYS SYRIA PREPARING FOR WAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli ambassador Eliahu Ben-Elissar accused Syria on Wednesday of preparing for war and said Israel's readiness had declined because the United States supplied advanced arms to Egypt and other Arab states.</p>
<p>Syria was the greatest threat to Israel in the short run, he told American defense writers at a breakfast meeting. Syria, he said, declared itself ready for peace negotiations &quot;but they are preparing for war.&quot;</p>
</text>
